  "elements": [
    {
      "id": "yKNdI5wXAtLkPye4KxzcK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 425.63671875,
      "y": -658,
      "width": 294.11981201171875,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a1",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1943964290,
      "version": 68,
      "versionNonce": 1219412313,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1772887420422,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Job scheduler\n\n1. register and schedule a job ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Job scheduler\n\n1. register and schedule a job ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "QHELdKd7OqwjoW_c6EZFr",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 398,
      "y": -523,
      "width": 996.7194213867188,
      "height": 400,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a5",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 360963358,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 417967518,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1772621136635,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirements\n\nClients can schedule a job to run at a specific future time\nClients can schedule recurring jobs using a cron expression (e.g. 0 9 * * MON — every Monday at 9am)\nA job has a type and a payload (e.g. type: SEND_INVOICE, payload: { invoice_id: 123 })\nJobs can be cancelled before they execute\nClients can query the status of a job\nFailed jobs should be retried up to a configurable number of times\n\nNon-Functional Requirements\n\nThe system must support 10 million active scheduled jobs\nThe system must fire up to 10,000 jobs per second at peak\nJobs should execute within 5 seconds of their scheduled time\nThe system must guarantee at-least-once execution — no job should be silently dropped\nThe scheduler itself must have no single point of failure",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirements\n\nClients can schedule a job to run at a specific future time\nClients can schedule recurring jobs using a cron expression (e.g. 0 9 * * MON — every Monday at 9am)\nA job has a type and a payload (e.g. type: SEND_INVOICE, payload: { invoice_id: 123 })\nJobs can be cancelled before they execute\nClients can query the status of a job\nFailed jobs should be retried up to a configurable number of times\n\nNon-Functional Requirements\n\nThe system must support 10 million active scheduled jobs\nThe system must fire up to 10,000 jobs per second at peak\nJobs should execute within 5 seconds of their scheduled time\nThe system must guarantee at-least-once execution — no job should be silently dropped\nThe scheduler itself must have no single point of failure",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "fThyDhbsERhKhy5Cn34ek",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 514.14453125,
      "y": -71.85546875,
      "width": 426.27972412109375,
      "height": 500,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a6",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1949232798,
      "version": 404,
      "versionNonce": 1579918455,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1772887715675,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "JOB\n- job_type\n- payload -(data related to job to process)\n- start_time\n- is_recurring\n- cron_interval\n\nAPIs\n\njobs\n\npost /api/v1/jobs\n    - job_type\n    - payload\n    - start_time(optional)\n    - recurring ?\n    - cron_expr\n\nget /api/v1/job/:id\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "JOB\n- job_type\n- payload -(data related to job to process)\n- start_time\n- is_recurring\n- cron_interval\n\nAPIs\n\njobs\n\npost /api/v1/jobs\n    - job_type\n    - payload\n    - start_time(optional)\n    - recurring ?\n    - cron_expr\n\nget /api/v1/job/:id\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
